  ('starting-conversations-with-strangers', 294, 'Learn how to say "hello" and "thank you" in the local language before a trip, and use them with a shopkeeper.'),
  ('starting-conversations-with-strangers', 295, 'Ask a fellow traveler at a hostel or hotel breakfast what they''ve enjoyed most about the city.'),
