  ('starting-conversations-with-strangers', 349, 'Share a weather observation with someone at a gas pump in the early morning: "Frost on the windshield already."'),
  ('starting-conversations-with-strangers', 350, 'Ask someone at a late-night pharmacy or diner how their night has been, keeping it short and in a well-lit place.'),
